$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM i-PrI Acceleration of Negishi Cross-Coupling Reactions
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Kienle, Marcel; Knochel, Paul
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Letters (2010), 12(12), 2702-2705

